OL,3,GNEWSASchool pupils send messages to
OL,4,Aprime minister
OL,5,
OL,6,FSchool pupils have been telling the
OL,7,Fchildren's commissioner what they want
OL,8,Fthe government to do for them ` from
OL,9,Fproviding new play areas to more job
OL,10,Fopportunities.
OL,12,FDame Rachel de Souza visited St Mary's
OL,13,FCollege, a secondary school in Hull,
OL,14,Ffollowing the launch of an England-wide
OL,15,Fchildren's survey, called The Big
OL,16,FFuture.
OL,18,FThe commissioner's office said it had
OL,19,Freceived more than a million responses,
OL,20,Fwith St Mary's sending the highest
OL,21,Fnumber.
OL,23,APub: 16-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
