OL,3,GNEWSASchool pupils send messages to
OL,4,Aprime minister
OL,5,
OL,6,FDame Rachel said she had some
OL,7,F"powerful" messages from young people
OL,8,Fand added: "I'm going to take these
OL,9,Fresponses to the prime minister and
OL,10,Feveryone is really excited to hear what
OL,11,Fthe kids think we should be doing for
OL,12,Fthem."
